show("social", nm.marketing.post_social_media("100,000 teams. Enterprise update: 45 organizations signed in the first two weeks of our enterprise desk, and every enterprise account now has a named engineer for escalations. Support is 24/7 and we are adding staff weekly. Quality releases continue every week."))
